{"2714457168":10,"3871231066":30,"4188031367":-20}},{"name":"Steady Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/6c6e1cc341487a8afd0b0c714a229255.png","desc":"This magazine is optimized for recoil control.\n  •  Greatly increases stability \n  •  Slightly decreases range\n  •  Increases airborne effectiveness","s":{"155624089":15,"1240592695":-5,"2714457168":7}},{"name":"Alloy Magazine","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/069170916c98748b7b3e33b80bd7d689.png","desc":"Faster reload when the magazine is nearly empty."},{"name":"Flared Magwell","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/f95e67e4ff37466505d66d3fa1030782.png","desc":"Optimized for fast reloading.\n  •  Slightly increases stability\n  •  Greatly increases reload speed","s":{"155624089":5,"4188031367":15}},{"name":"Ricochet Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0a494d0442b32aff8c30d8b2b53561bd.png","desc":"Rounds ricochet off hard surfaces. \n  •  Increases stability \n  •  Slightly increases range","s":{"155624089":10,"1240592695":5}},{"name":"Light Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/736b486ddb80beefacb4f09b5ad016eb.png","desc":"Improved reload and range.\n  •  Increases reload speed\n  •  Slightly increases range","s":{"1240592695":5,"4188031367":10}},{"name":"Armor-Piercing Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/b311ef00478243e21e2a5eec3a59f9d8.png","desc":"Rounds cause extra damage to combatants' shields and overpenetrate targets. \n  •  Slightly increases range","s":{"1240592695":5}},{"name":"Drop Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9d19f0c349652f0285bb5f999307b8a1.png","desc":"Increases reload speed but reduces magazine size.","s":{"4188031367":30}},{"name":"Assault Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/953cfdeb2703978b1ab449b991b98989.png","desc":"This shotgun's magazine is optimized for quick combat.\n  •  Greatly increases stability\n  •  Increases rate of fire","s":{"155624089":15,"4284893193":10}},{"name":"High-Caliber Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9d1c49edb2d2b24c74067742c09fd5a5.png","desc":"Shots from this weapon knock the target back farther.\n  •  Slightly increases range","s":{"1240592695":5}}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Steady Hands","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ed60dd27f28737cbfc77bf41c3784c01.png","desc":"Kills provide improved handling for all weapons for a short duration."},{"name":"Stats for All","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8aadd7fd25c2b1e9f3fc7f4411a97ea4.png","desc":"Hitting three separate targets increases weapon handling, stability, reload, and range for a moderate duration."},{"name":"Perpetual Motion","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8b9a4582016210723532907414759e69.png","desc":"This weapon gains bonus stability, handling, and reload speed while the wielder is in motion."},{"name":"Zen Moment","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9650a58cd3a439bf3b53a53dbc8122a0.png","desc":"Causing damage with this weapon reduces recoil and flinch over time."},{"name":"Triple Tap","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0795f44c0c3611b15428742c67918cd1.png","desc":"Rapidly landing precision hits will return one round to the magazine."},{"name":"Compulsive Reloader","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ef5843dfe8134c7385945216ece2bb06.png","desc":"Grants increased reload speed when close to full magazine."}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"One for All","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/b1bce269c3cd21393131b4f5cffae692.png","desc":"Hitting three separate targets increases damage for a moderate duration."},{"name":"Vorpal Weapon","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/bc5130b227ee577f2678ec2d2c97bf4a.png","desc":"Increased damage against bosses, vehicles, and Guardians with their Super active."},{"name":"Frenzy","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/23e06f4ced1b3e6476f342978ff5bb37.png","desc":"Being in combat for an extended time increases damage, handling, and reload for this weapon until you are out of combat."},{"name":"Rampage","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8976ead57430e4f5f8af1b3005de4f83.png","desc":"Kills with this weapon temporarily grant increased damage. Stacks 3x."},{"name":"Dynamic Sway Reduction","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/36091de4dd029fb6e6ab95dbc612ff05.png","desc":"Improves accuracy and stability while continuously holding down the trigger."},{"name":"Fourth Time's the Charm","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a5edd4e751e1aa34bf8328a63b121e71.png","desc":"Rapidly landing precision hits will return two rounds to the magazine."}]},{"label":"Origin Trait","weight":0.5,"perks":[{"name":"Stunning Recovery","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0deaae9c67009f285a400ab5dd407138.png","desc":"Stunning a Champion refills your magazine, triggers health regeneration, and improves recovery for a short duration."},{"name":"Vanguard's Vindication","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/c7feebe5d55e4611c5d031d50eaca7ed.png","desc":"Final blows with this weapon grant a small amount of health."}]}],"notes":["pandapaxxy (PvE / M+KB / Controller): \"With triple tap, fourth time’s the charm, and actium war rig, you could fire forever. In most cases that is entirely a meme, but against specific bosses it could be useful to have. A more utilitarian roll would be triple tap with vorpal weapon to slot in adept big ones when the grandmaster nightfalls release. Ideally you want to bring up the recoil direction from the base 60, but chambered compensator or extended barrel won’t do as much, and you won’t want to slot a counterbalance mod in favor of any of the spec mods. Arrowhead then becomes the only choice to really improve that recoil to something more desirable. Other options are then just to make the gun feel better. Stats for all pairs really well with one for all, but also fourth time’s the charm or vorpal for a better feeling gun. And perpetual motion will elevate the gun feel without needing to shoot.\". Recommended MW - Reload.","pandapaxxy (PvP / M+KB): \"In the crucible there isn’t as much to talk about. perpetual motion or steady hands will enhance your loadout and dynamic sway reduction will help keep your bullets on target. The adaptive frame autos haven’t been extremely meta since their adjustment, but the likes of gnawing hunger or summoner will do a better job.\". Recommended MW - Range or Handling.","pandapaxxy (PvP / Controller): \"In the crucible there isn’t as much to talk about. perpetual motion or steady hands will enhance your loadout and dynamic sway reduction will help keep your bullets on target. The adaptive frame autos haven’t been extremely meta since their adjustment, but the likes of gnawing hunger or summoner will do a better job.\". Recommended MW - Stability.","Inspired by DMB Player Versus Enemies Podcast 11. PvE first choice roll for end-game content. Not too much to offer over other kinetic adaptive auto-rifles like Scathelocke or The Last Breath, other the the origin traits. Recoil Direction and stability both need some attention, so Arrowhead Brake and a stability mag perk help. The \"All for All\" pairing works well to both boost useful stats and damage. Recommended MW: Stability, with a Backup Mag or damage-boosting (Minor, Major, or Taken Spec) mod.","Inspired by DMB Player Versus Enemies Podcast 11. PvE first choice roll for end-game content. Not too much to offer over other kinetic adaptive auto-rifles like Scathelocke or The Last Breath, other the the origin traits. Recoil Direction and stability both need some attention, so Arrowhead Brake and a stability mag perk help. For endgame rolls you're looking for traits that boost stats or effective mag size and damage without needing a kill. Recommended MW: Stability, with a Backup Mag or damage-boosting (Minor, Major, or Taken Spec) mod.","Inspired by DMB Player Versus Enemies Podcast 11. PvE first choice roll for general content. Not too much to offer over other kinetic adaptive auto-rifles like Scathelocke or The Last Breath, other the the origin traits. Recoil Direction and stability both need some attention, so Arrowhead Brake and a stability mag perk help. There are traits that boost stats (including reload speed) or effective mag size and in non-endgame activities, Rampage is always reliable. Recommended MW: Stability, with a Backup Mag or damage-boosting (Minor, Major, or Taken Spec) mod.","[YeezyGT's WQ] [Arrowhead / Counterbalance recommended] [MW: Range / Stability] \"Duty Bound is another 600RPM Kinetic with very little fat in the perk pool - some great perks in Frenzy/Vorpal/Rampage/One-for-All, an Origin Trait similar to a bonus Unrelenting, and some consistency options in Perpetual/Zen Moment. The recoil does not feel great on console at all - I'd spec heavily into stability and recoil direction.\" tags:pve","Chevy's S16 Super Pog PvE Loot List. Recommended MW - Reload/Range"],"craftable":false,"sources":["Season of the Risen Nightfall Grandmaster"],"activities":[],"hash":1135050595,"vendors":[],"frame":"Adaptive Frame","stats":{"list":[{"h":4284893193,"name":"Rounds Per Minute","max":100,"num":true,"interp":[[0,360],[10,400],[20,450],[80,600],[100,720]]},{"h":4043523819,"name":"Impact","max":100,"num":false,"interp":[[0,18],[20,21],[80,29],[90,31],[100,33]]},{"h":1240592695,"name":"Range","max":100,"num":false,"interp":[[0,0],[100,100]]},{"h":155624089,"name":"Stability","max":100,"num":false,"interp":[[0,0],[100,100]]},{"h":943549884,"name":"Handling","max":100,"num":false,"interp":[[0,0],[100,100]]},{"h":4188031367,"name":"Reload Speed","max":100,"num":false,"interp":[[0,0],[100,100]]},{"h":3871231066,"name":"Magazine","max":100,"num":true,"interp":[[0,33],[9,33],[10,36],[19,36],[20,39],[29,39],[30,41],[39,41],[40,44],[49,44],[50,47],[59,47],[60,49],[69,49],[70,52],[79,52],[80,55],[89,55],[90,57],[99,57],[100,60]]},{"h":1345609583,"name":"Aim Assistance","max":100,"num":false,"interp":[[0,0],[100,100]]},{"h":3555269338,"name":"Zoom","max":100,"num":false,"interp":[[0,0],[100,100]]},{"h":2